WEBVTT

00:04:29.032 --> 00:04:30.897
that's extra critical.

00:04:30.921 --> 00:04:33.315
Usually, it's somebody using a technology

00:04:33.339 --> 00:04:35.551
on a day-to-day basis
to do his or her job.

00:04:36.564 --> 00:04:37.749
At Bovingdons,

00:04:37.773 --> 00:04:40.837
the finance director with
the accounting platform would be one.

00:04:41.387 --> 00:04:45.230
Next, I would check on the status
of their collaboration.

00:04:45.254 --> 00:04:46.739
Are they working well together?

00:04:46.763 --> 00:04:47.993
Getting along?

00:04:48.017 --> 00:04:51.341
In this case, it turned out to be
a tenuous relationship.

00:04:51.937 --> 00:04:53.672
So, what to do?

00:04:53.696 --> 00:04:58.372
Well, if the accounting platform
were actually a person,

00:04:58.396 --> 00:05:01.693
the finance director would feel
responsible for managing it